{
    "title": "Doll Color: Princess Coloring",
    "description": "Explore a magical world of art and creativity with Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art - the ultimate coloring book app for creative kids who love princess themes!\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in 200+ imaginative coloring pages featuring cute anime, manga, and cartoon characters. Find joy in a one-of-a-kind kawaii painting experience with this top coloring game for girls.\r\n\r\nPictures\ud83c\udfa8 \ud83c\udfa8\r\nThe game includes beautifully crafted picture content:\r\n\u2605 Princesses\r\n\u2605 Unicorns (cute unicorns and their princess friends)\r\n\u2605 Animals (teach kids about various cute animals while coloring)\r\n\u2605 Fashion (various fashionable outfits to develop aesthetic ability)\r\n\u2605 Castles (dreamy princess rooms, castles, and gardens)\r\n\r\nFeatures\u2728 \u2728\r\n\u2605 Unique anime-style graphics suitable for all ages!\r\n\u2605 Over 20 rich-colored palettes, gradient colors, colors with sparkling effects, and pattern stickers, meeting all of your color needs!\r\n\u2605 Overlapping 3D effects, so all colors look great! This game boosts kids\u2019 confidence by making coloring easier and unleashing their imagination!\r\n\u2605 \u201cUndo\u201d and \u201cClear All\u201d functions!\r\n\u2605 Support for creating multiple canvases. You can paint a single picture many times and save all of them!\r\n\u2605 Save the drawing in your album, and then share or edit it!\r\n\r\nStay inspired by constantly updated images and pictures in this popular coloring game for kids. Build your own collection of beautiful, vibrant masterpieces and show them off on social media.\r\n\r\nMORE COLORING FUN \ud83c\udfa8 \ud83c\udfa8\r\nImprove your painting skills with easy to challenging artwork in this art game for kids. Revisit completed pieces anytime for more coloring fun.\r\n\r\nEASY NAVIGATION \ud83d\udd8c \ud83d\udd8c\r\nEnjoy access to this fun coloring book for girls. Easy navigation makes it perfect for kids of all ages.\r\n\r\nMANGA DREAMS TO LIFE \u2728 \u2728\r\nWhether you're a seasoned artist or just starting out, Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art is the perfect way to bring your manga dreams to life through drawing for kids and toddler coloring activities.\r\n\r\nWith its wide variety of kawaii themes and picture categories, user-friendly controls, and fresh images, Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art offers the ultimate creative outlet for artistic kids. \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy\r\nAt Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art, the well-being of children and families is our top priority. We prioritize privacy and adhere to all relevant regulations. For detailed information on our privacy policy, please visit: https://sites.google.com/view/joycraze-family-privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Explore a magical world of art and creativity with Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art - the ultimate coloring book app for creative kids who love princess themes!<br><br>Immerse yourself in 200+ imaginative coloring pages featuring cute anime, manga, and cartoon characters. Find joy in a one-of-a-kind kawaii painting experience with this top coloring game for girls.<br><br>Pictures\ud83c\udfa8 \ud83c\udfa8<br>The game includes beautifully crafted picture content:<br>\u2605 Princesses<br>\u2605 Unicorns (cute unicorns and their princess friends)<br>\u2605 Animals (teach kids about various cute animals while coloring)<br>\u2605 Fashion (various fashionable outfits to develop aesthetic ability)<br>\u2605 Castles (dreamy princess rooms, castles, and gardens)<br><br>Features\u2728 \u2728<br>\u2605 Unique anime-style graphics suitable for all ages!<br>\u2605 Over 20 rich-colored palettes, gradient colors, colors with sparkling effects, and pattern stickers, meeting all of your color needs!<br>\u2605 Overlapping 3D effects, so all colors look great! This game boosts kids\u2019 confidence by making coloring easier and unleashing their imagination!<br>\u2605 \u201cUndo\u201d and \u201cClear All\u201d functions!<br>\u2605 Support for creating multiple canvases. You can paint a single picture many times and save all of them!<br>\u2605 Save the drawing in your album, and then share or edit it!<br><br>Stay inspired by constantly updated images and pictures in this popular coloring game for kids. Build your own collection of beautiful, vibrant masterpieces and show them off on social media.<br><br>MORE COLORING FUN \ud83c\udfa8 \ud83c\udfa8<br>Improve your painting skills with easy to challenging artwork in this art game for kids. Revisit completed pieces anytime for more coloring fun.<br><br>EASY NAVIGATION \ud83d\udd8c \ud83d\udd8c<br>Enjoy access to this fun coloring book for girls. Easy navigation makes it perfect for kids of all ages.<br><br>MANGA DREAMS TO LIFE \u2728 \u2728<br>Whether you&#39;re a seasoned artist or just starting out, Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art is the perfect way to bring your manga dreams to life through drawing for kids and toddler coloring activities.<br><br>With its wide variety of kawaii themes and picture categories, user-friendly controls, and fresh images, Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art offers the ultimate creative outlet for artistic kids. <br><br>Privacy Policy<br>At Doll Color: Princess Coloring Art, the well-being of children and families is our top priority. We prioritize privacy and adhere to all relevant regulations. For detailed information on our privacy policy, please visit: https://sites.google.com/view/joycraze-family-privacy",
